    ["<Highlight>俱乐部乱斗</>源自一个镜盘样式的拥有古代学者能力的封印物，玩家可以作为暂时使用古代学者能力的召唤师，召唤出其中的<Highlight>历史投影</>进行对决。历史投影是选取了玩家过去某一时间点的状态，形成了对应样子的历史投影。\n玩法于每周周二、周四中午<Highlight>12:00</>开放报名，并于晚间<Highlight>19:00~20:30</>开启战斗（服务器首届比赛将于周六<Highlight>中午12点</>开放报名）。\n开放的轮次将根据上一届玩法<Highlight>参与人数</>决定（俱乐部成员需在20人以上，活跃度100以上，俱乐部内首届比赛轮次将根据俱乐部成员人数决定）。"] = "<Highlight>Club Brawl</> originates from a mirror-disk-style Sealed Artifact that possesses the abilities of an Ancient Scholar. Players can act as Summoners temporarily using the abilities of an Ancient Scholar to summon <Highlight>Historical Projections</> from within to duel. A Historical Projection is a state of the player selected from a past point in time, forming a Historical Projection of the corresponding appearance. \nRegistration for the gameplay opens every Tuesday and Thursday at <Highlight>12:00</>, and combat begins in the evening from <Highlight>19:00~20:30</> (the server's first competition will open for registration on Saturday at <Highlight>12:00 noon</>). \nThe number of rounds opened will be determined by the <Highlight>number of participants</> in the previous session (Clubs must have more than 20 members with an activity level of 100 or higher; the first competition round within the Club will be determined by the number of Club members).",
