    ["<Yellow>毒雾弥漫</>：携带者受到8米内的敌人攻击时，有<Yellow>100%</>的基础概率使其随机染上3种毒素之一，持续<Yellow>8秒</>，每种毒素最多叠加<Yellow>5层</>。染毒效果每0.5秒最多触发1次，对单个目标每2秒最多触发1次。\n<Yellow>毒素侵染</>：携带此封印物5分钟后，进入<Yellow>毒素入骨</>状态，携带者在该状态下死亡时会残留持续<Yellow>10秒</>的毒池。毒池出现时，有<Yellow>100%</>基础概率禁锢范围内的敌人<Yellow>3秒</>，并每秒尝试给范围内的敌人各施加1层3种毒素，身处毒池内时，移动速度降低<Yellow>50%</>，毒池最多影响<Yellow>10</>人。\n三种毒素具体效果如下：\n\n<Yellow>麻痹毒素</>：降低<Yellow>*f**</>攻击速度，最多5层，5层后继续添加时，有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</>的固定概率进入1秒的滞涩状态；\n<Yellow>虚弱毒素</>：降低<Yellow>*f**</>攻击力，最多5层，5层后继续添加时，有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</>的固定概率进入1秒的沉默状态；\n<Yellow>疲劳毒素</>：降低<Yellow>*f**</>移动速度，最多5层，5层后继续添加时，有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</>的固定概率进入1秒的减速50%状态。"] = "<Yellow>Poison Mist Filling</>: When the carrier is attacked by an enemy within 8 meters, there is a <Yellow>100%</> base probability of causing them to be randomly infected with one of 3 toxins, lasting <Yellow>8 seconds</>, with each toxin stacking up to <Yellow>5 layers</>. The poisoning effect can trigger at most once every 0.5 seconds, and at most once every 2 seconds for a single target. \n<Yellow>Toxin Infection</>: After carrying this Sealed Artifact for 5 minutes, you enter the <Yellow>Toxin into Bone</> state. When the carrier dies in this state, they leave behind a poison pool lasting <Yellow>10 seconds</>. When the poison pool appears, there is a <Yellow>100%</> base probability of Imprisonment on enemies within the range for <Yellow>3 seconds</>, and it attempts to apply 1 layer of each of the 3 toxins to enemies in the range every second. While in the poison pool, movement speed is reduced by <Yellow>50%</>, and the poison pool affects at most <Yellow>10</> people. \nThe specific effects of the three toxins are as follows: \n\n<Yellow>Paralytic Toxin</>: Reduces <Yellow>*f**</> Attack Speed, up to 5 layers. After 5 layers, continuing to add layers has a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</> fixed probability of entering a 1-second Stagnation state; \n<Yellow>Weakening Toxin</>: Reduces <Yellow>*f**</> Attack, up to 5 layers. After 5 layers, continuing to add layers has a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</> fixed probability of entering a 1-second Silence state; \n<Yellow>Fatigue Toxin</>: Reduces <Yellow>*f**</> movement speed, up to 5 layers. After 5 layers, continuing to add layers has a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=2?55%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085008)=3?70%}</> fixed probability of entering a 1-second 50% Slow state.",
